# Router Advertisement with the options of a full radvd configuration: source link-layer
# address, MTU 1480 (a PPPoE uplink), a prefix, the recursive DNS servers of RFC 8106 section
# 5.1 and the DNS search list of section 5.2 (an option the parser keeps as "other"). The
# flags are 0x48: O on, M off, router preference high (bits 3 and 4 = 01). Router
# fe80::200:5eff:fe00:5304.
#
# type 134, code 0, checksum 0x5061
86 00 50 61
# cur hop limit 64, flags 0x48, router lifetime 1800 s
40 48 07 08
# reachable time 30000 ms, retransmit timer 1000 ms
00 00 75 30
00 00 03 e8
# option 1, source link-layer address 00:00:5e:00:53:04
01 01 00 00 5e 00 53 04
# option 5, MTU, 1 unit: reserved 0, MTU 1480
05 01 00 00 00 00 05 c8
# option 3, prefix information, 4 units: prefix length 64, flags 0xc0 (L, A)
03 04 40 c0
# valid lifetime 86400 s, preferred lifetime 14400 s, reserved
00 01 51 80
00 00 38 40
00 00 00 00
# prefix 2001:db8:100::
20 01 0d b8 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
# option 25, RDNSS, 5 units: reserved 0, lifetime 1200 s
19 05 00 00
00 00 04 b0
# server 2001:db8:100::53
20 01 0d b8 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 53
# server 2001:db8:100::54
20 01 0d b8 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 54
# option 31, DNSSL, 3 units: reserved 0, lifetime 1200 s
1f 03 00 00
00 00 04 b0
# search domain example.net in DNS wire format, then 3 octets of padding
07 65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65 03 6e 65 74 00
00 00 00
